  concept: 'Authored objective: Calibrate protected power and sensors.

    Authored
    requirement: Confirm the protected input, all regulated rails, fresh W075 validity
    and agreeing voltage/current readings.

    General teaching principle: Electrical
    measurements are differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating
    condition and fresh solver evidence.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence
    can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A pressure gauge needs a reference; a voltage measurement likewise depends
    on its defined points.
